        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Omuntu asobola okwagaanibwa ng'aitiibwa eyo mu nsiko mu nsi Musengwa Katonda waimwe y'ali kubagha, aye ng'amwise tamanhiibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo bwe kinaabangagho, abakulembeze n'abalamuzi baimwe baidha kujanga bapime obuleeyi obuligho, okuva ku mulambo okutuuka ku buli kindi ku bibuga ebiriiraine agho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakulembeze ab'ekibuga ekisinga okuba okumpi n'omulambo gw'omuntu eyaitiibwa, banaatwalanga ente ento etakozesebwangaku mirimo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baagiserengesa mu kiiko omuli amaadhi agakuuluula, nga tikirimwangamu waire okusigibwamu ebirime. Olwo baamenha enkoto yaayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bakabona Abalevi boona banaajanga, kuba abo Musengwa Katonda waimwe be yalondamu okumugheerezanga, n'okusabiranga abantu enkabi mu liina lye. Era abo n'abasalagho ensonga dh'abakaayana, n'abatuusagainiaku ebiwundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo abakulembeze boonaboona ab'omu kibuga ekisinga okuba okumpi n'omulambo gw'omuntu eyaitiibwa, banaanaabiranga engalo dhaibwe ku nte ento ere emenheibwa enkoto mu kiiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era banaakobanga bati, ‘Ti niife otwatemula omuntu ono, era titwidhi yamutemula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wo Musengwa Katonda, sonigha abantu bo Abaisiraeli be wanunula, olobe kubavunaana kutemula muntu aziraku musango.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni bwe munaakolanga ebyo Musengwa Katonda by'abona nga bituufu, munaabanga nga mwetoireku ekibi eky'okwita abantu abaziraku musango.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Bwe munaajanga mu lutalo okulwana, Musengwa Katonda waimwe n'abata abazigu baimwe mu ngalo ni mubaghangula, era ni mubatwala nga basibe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "memale iwe n'obonamu omukazi omulungi, n'oyenda okumubayiza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "onaamutwalanga ewuwo mu ndhu yo. Anaamwanga omutwe gwe, era yaasalaku n'enkumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo yaakyusa ebivaalo, yaatoolamu bye yaghambirwamu, yaaba mu ndhu yo okumala omwezi mulamba ng'ali kulira ise n'inhina. Ekyo nga kiwoire, onaabanga wa idembe okumubayiza waaba naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho bw'onaabanga nga takaakunhoonha, onaamulekanga yaaja y'ayenda, aye otamutundangamu mpiiya. Era otamubisanga ng'oti mwiru, kuba wamala okumukaka okukubayira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omusaadha asobola okuba ni bakazi be babiri, ng'owundi mwende aye ng'owundi munobe. Bombi baamuzaalira abaana abalenzi, aye ng'omwana omulenzi omuberi, n'ow'omukazi omunobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaadha oyo bw'anaatuusanga okulaamira abaana be ebintu by'ali nabyo, taatoolenga mwana wa mukazi mwende n'amufuula kuba muberi mu kifo ky'omwana omuberi omutuufu eyazaalibwa omukazi omunobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye aidha kuganhanga okutwala omwana ow'omukazi omunobe, nga n'omuberi. Olwo aghenga omwana oyo omugabo gwe ogw'emikuzi ebiri, ku bintu bye byonabyona by'ali nabyo. Kuba oyo n'omwana we eyasooka okuva mu maani ge. N'olw'ekyo oyo n'agwaniire ebintu ebiri n'okugheebwa omwana omuberi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abazaire basobola okuba ni mutabane waibwe ow'empwitu era omudheemu, atagondera ise oba inhina, era nga ni bwe bamubonereza taganha kubawulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazaire abo banaamutwalanga y'abakulembeze b'ekibuga eky'ewaibwe, mu kifo eky'olwekobaano ku mulyango ogwingira ekibuga ekyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baabakobera bati, ‘Omwana waife ono ali n'empwitu era mudheemu, taganha kugondera bye tumukoba. Ali n'omuwuudu gw'okulya era mutamiivu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abasaadha boonaboona ab'omu kibuga ekyo, baidha kumukubanga amabaale bamwite. Mu nsambo eyo munaabanga nga mwetoiremu ekibi ekyo. Agho Abaisiraeli boonaboona bwe banaawuliranga ekibairegho, baidha kutyanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omuntu bw'anaakolanga ekibi ekimugwaniiza okufa, era nga mumaze okumwita, ni mumughanika ku muti n'alengeedhera okwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omulambo gwe tiguusulenga ku muti okwo, aye munaaguziikanga ku lunaku olwo lwene. Kuba omulambo ogughanikiibwa ku muti ni gulengeedhera okwo guleeta ekikolimo kya Katonda ku nsi. Kale ni mulobenga kwonoona nsi Musengwa Katonda waimwe y'ali kubagha okuba obutaka bwaimwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
